  "description": "noppomario's mods. Today: mermaid fences drawn where Claude writes them — as text on the terminal, as vector graphics on a surface that takes them, and through MessageDisplay where the engine draws nothing itself. The modules key needs CLAUDE_CODE_ENABLE_FUNCTION_HOOKS=1; builds without function hooks ignore it and keep the MessageDisplay hook.",
